# P17 Git branch / worktree discipline

**Authority:** `.aster/skills/plan/references/portable.md` (legacy `.kstudio/...` ok)

Any agent in this repo (O / B / R / M / I / S / D and aliases):

1. MUST NOT privately run `git switch -c`, `git checkout -b`, `git branch <new>`, or `git worktree add` unless the **user or conductor explicitly authorized that exact branch/worktree in this turn**.
2. MUST work only on the branch named in the dispatch note or `lineage.roles[].code.branch`.
3. If a new branch is required: **ask first**, then record it in lineage after approval.
4. MUST NOT silently move the user’s workspace onto a private branch (causes apparent feature rollback at merge).
5. Short reports MUST state the actual branch used.
